        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Finally, we intend to execute on our existing research and development pipeline, with the goal of generating incremental revenues from both in-line and new products that provide solutions to unmet medical needs in transplantation.",
